        "content": "<p>jrandolf opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14840\">PR #14840</a> from <code>jrandolf:c-api-map-value-tests</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The C API supports map values, but only the map <em>type</em> was tested. This adds value round-trip tests for <code>map&lt;string, u32&gt;</code> and <code>map&lt;u32, list&lt;string&gt;&gt;</code>, including duplicate keys, and documents in <code>val.h</code> that map entries keep their order and may contain duplicate keys.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
